+   band stands ON the grid line rather than inside the cell; (2) both passes (and the invalid
+   tier's) drop from 12 to 10 units, so the scaled band paints about the same weight (6.189 px
+   against the shipped 6.273 at 393, -1.3 %). Its price: the band swallows the focused cell's
+   own grid line (0.33-0.5 px of paper between them). */
+.game-cell:has(input:focus-visible) .cell-ghost svg {
+  transform: scale(1.1);
+  transform-origin: 50% 50%;
+}
